# Copyrighted reference material kept locally for rules lookups, not for redistribution.
# (Only the PDF itself -- spec/rulebooks/learnings.md is this project's own original notes and is
# meant to be tracked; discovered during WP25 that this rule had been silently swallowing it,
# so every prior WP's "recorded in learnings.md" claim was never actually committed. See WP25's
# worklog.)
/spec/rulebooks/*.pdf
